**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
# Test and lint caches are local-only. Besides adding no runtime value, some
# Windows-created cache directories can be unreadable to Docker while it packs
# the build context.
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.hypothesis/
.coverage
**/.coverage
htmlcov/
dist
build
# The React bundle is produced inside the image. Excluding the host output
# also prevents Docker from traversing OneDrive reparse points in front/dist.
front/dist/
react-ui/dist/
react-ui/.runtime-vendor/
# The source TIFF is retained locally for re-export only; the runtime uses
# the known-good low-resolution lunar texture stored alongside the basemaps.
front/assets/basemap/Moon_color_16bit_srgb_4k.tif
# Imported precise GNSS products and manual ERP snapshots are mutable runtime
# state. Compose mounts config/ at runtime, so baking either local data store
# into the build context is unnecessary, can expose user-provided data in an
# image layer, and can make Docker fail while archiving OneDrive reparse points.
config/precise-products/
config/manual-erp-snapshots/
tests/artifacts
server/ui-artifacts/
